From: coolsnowwolf <coolsnowwolf@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] tls: restore explicit allowInsecure compatibility

Restore the opt-in TLS option for legacy proxy certificates, including
Hysteria2 servers without SANs. Keep certificate verification enabled by
default and continue enforcing explicit certificate pins and names.

Signed-off-by: coolsnowwolf <coolsnowwolf@gmail.com>

--- a/infra/conf/transport_security.go
+++ b/infra/conf/transport_security.go
@@ -358,9 +358,7 @@
